index 0000000..5ff9222
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/7490.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+Fixed a bug where an ``xfail`` marker added dynamically during the test call
+(for example, with ``request.node.add_marker(pytest.mark.xfail(...))``) was
+ignored, causing the test to be reported as a failure instead of xfailed.
